Package: zfspin
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3
Recommends: zfsutils-linux
Description: ZFS/Kernel version pinning for safe system updates
 Zfspin is a tool for managing Arch Linux systems with ZFS root filesystems.
 It ensures kernel and ZFS module compatibility during system updates by:
 .
  - Pinning compatible kernel/ZFS versions from archzfs.com
  - Creating ZFS boot environments before updates for safe rollback
  - Preferring LTS kernel with fallback to standard if unavailable
 .
 Features:
  - Auto-detects compatible kernel/ZFS versions
  - Creates ZFS snapshots before updates
  - Provides kernel package locking
  - Systemd timer for automatic updates
